# Claude Code's own local session/tooling state - launch.json has a
# machine-specific absolute path, scheduled_tasks.lock is pure per-session
# runtime state. Each subproject (backend/, frontend/, engine/) has its own
# .gitignore for its build artifacts/dependencies/.env - this file only
# covers what's specific to the repo root.
.claude/

